                        "entry_id": "4f98ce12-8ed7-3536-b47b-ba2dcbe34016",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having a corolla in the form of a butterfly, with prominent wing-like petals; (generally) pertaining to the Faboidea (Papilionoidea) family of plants."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc9fe00b-4e82-4615-97f2-23440cd860f4",
                                "sense_id": "13faf44b-8c27-3810-bceb-6402c8620b5a",
                                "text": "[T]he broad road is lined with wild bushes and tangled shrubs lavishly decked with brilliant blossoms: the lentisk, so covered with yellow, papilionaceous flowers [translating Schmetterlingsblumen] that not a green leaf is visible…"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
